            <note corresp="#d19-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d19-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Job 84B00049R, Subject Files (1981–1982) Box
                    7, NSPG Meeting re: [<hi rendition="#italic">text not
